{
  "version": 1,
  "name": "search-quality-benchmark",
  "description": "全站搜索召回质量基准集（feat-search-discovery-20260928）。同时被单元测试（src/lib/__tests__/searchBenchmark.test.ts）与部署验收（S1-S4）对照使用。验证集为 src/data 本地 fallback 种子数据（空 Notion Key 降级路径）。",
  "corpus": {
    "blog": "src/data/blog.ts",
    "projects": "src/data/projects.ts"
  },
  "idConvention": "文档 id = `<type>:<seedId>`，例如 `blog:post-1`、`project:proj-3`。",
  "semantics": {
    "expectAnyOf": "结果集中至少命中其中一个 id（召回下界）。空数组表示不作召回要求。",
    "expectNoneOf": "结果集中不得出现任何一个 id（精确性下界，防误召回）。",
    "expectTopOf": "结果集第 1 条必须命中其中一个 id（排序质量）。空数组表示不作排序要求。"
  },
  "queries": [
    {
      "id": "en-1",
      "category": "en",
      "locale": "en",
      "q": "nextjs",
      "expectAnyOf": ["blog:post-1", "blog:post-10"],
      "expectNoneOf": ["blog:post-4"],
      "expectTopOf": [],
      "note": "英文单词检索 + 标点归一化（Next.js / nextjs 应等价）。"
    },
    {
      "id": "en-2",
      "category": "en",
      "locale": "en",
      "q": "tailwind css",
      "expectAnyOf": ["blog:post-2"],
      "expectNoneOf": ["blog:post-6"],
      "expectTopOf": [],
      "note": "英文多词 AND 检索。"
    },
    {
      "id": "en-3",
      "category": "en",
      "locale": "en",
      "q": "typescript generics",
      "expectAnyOf": ["blog:post-11"],
      "expectNoneOf": ["blog:post-3"],
      "expectTopOf": [],
      "note": "英文多词 AND 检索，命中标题中的两个词。"
    },
    {
      "id": "en-4",
      "category": "en",
      "locale": "en",
      "q": "docker",
      "expectAnyOf": ["project:proj-3", "project:proj-4"],
      "expectNoneOf": ["blog:post-4"],
      "expectTopOf": [],
      "note": "跨内容类型检索：项目 technologies 字段命中。"
    },
    {
      "id": "zh-1",
      "category": "zh",
      "locale": "zh",
      "q": "入门",
      "expectAnyOf": ["blog:post-1"],
      "expectNoneOf": ["blog:post-4"],
      "expectTopOf": [],
      "note": "中文词，且位于标题中段（「Next.js 14 入门指南」）——旧实现只能词头前缀命中，此处为改造核心验证点。"
    },
    {
      "id": "zh-2",
      "category": "zh",
      "locale": "zh",
      "q": "指南",
      "expectAnyOf": ["blog:post-1", "blog:post-11"],
      "expectNoneOf": ["blog:post-4"],
      "expectTopOf": [],
      "note": "中文词，位于标题末尾（后缀子串），非词头。"
    },
    {
      "id": "zh-3",
      "category": "zh",
      "locale": "zh",
      "q": "渲染",
      "expectAnyOf": ["blog:post-10"],
      "expectNoneOf": ["blog:post-2"],
      "expectTopOf": [],
      "note": "中文词，位于标题中段（「Next.js 中的服务端渲染与静态生成」）。"
    },
    {
      "id": "zh-4",
      "category": "zh",
      "locale": "zh",
      "q": "性能优化",
      "expectAnyOf": ["blog:post-12"],
      "expectNoneOf": ["blog:post-6"],
      "expectTopOf": [],
      "note": "中文多字词（4 字），要求分词后多 token AND 命中。"
    },
    {
      "id": "mix-1",
      "category": "mixed",
      "locale": "zh",
      "q": "Next.js 入门",
      "expectAnyOf": ["blog:post-1"],
      "expectNoneOf": ["blog:post-4"],
      "expectTopOf": [],
      "note": "中英混合：英文品牌词 + 中文词，两者都须命中同一文档。"
    },
    {
      "id": "mix-2",
      "category": "mixed",
      "locale": "zh",
      "q": "React 性能优化",
      "expectAnyOf": ["blog:post-12"],
      "expectNoneOf": ["blog:post-3"],
      "expectTopOf": [],
      "note": "中英混合：英文技术词 + 中文多字词。"
    },
    {
      "id": "mix-3",
      "category": "mixed",
      "locale": "zh",
      "q": "TypeScript 泛型",
      "expectAnyOf": ["blog:post-11"],
      "expectNoneOf": ["blog:post-5"],
      "expectTopOf": [],
      "note": "中英混合：中文词位于标题末尾。"
    },
    {
      "id": "mix-4",
      "category": "mixed",
      "locale": "zh",
      "q": "Tailwind 响应式",
      "expectAnyOf": ["blog:post-2"],
      "expectNoneOf": ["blog:post-6"],
      "expectTopOf": [],
      "note": "中英混合：英文技术词 + 中文词，中文词位于标题中段。"
    }
  ]
}
